Package: cockpit-bookmarks
Version: @VERSION@
Section: admin
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Maintainer: Aleksandr Chasnyk <69671996+ami3go@users.noreply.github.com>
Depends: cockpit
Recommends: iproute2
Suggests: cockpit-packagekit
Enhances: cockpit
Installed-Size: @INSTALLED_SIZE@
Homepage: https://github.com/ami3go/bookmarks
Description: lightweight Cockpit bookmarks page for local services
 Cockpit Bookmarks provides a static Cockpit page for organizing and opening
 services hosted on the same machine. It supports grouped bookmarks, search,
 favorites, edit-mode management, JSON configuration, history, and optional
 host-local service discovery.
 .
 AppStream metadata identifies this package as a Cockpit add-on so compatible
 Cockpit Applications/PackageKit installations can discover and manage it.
 Node.js and npm are not required on the target machine.
